# Excluded from the archive published to the Comfy Registry — NOT from the repo.
#
# Installing this pack copies the published archive into a user's custom_nodes/
# directory, where it sits for as long as they have the pack. Nothing below is
# imported at runtime (__init__.py loads styleref_nodes/* and server_routes
# only), so shipping it would put files on thousands of machines that no
# install ever reads.
#
# Everything here stays in the repository, where it is load-bearing: the tests
# run in CI, and scripts/build_workflows.py generates workflows/ and is what a
# contributor edits. Only the shipped package is smaller.
#
# workflows/ is deliberately NOT excluded — the templates are the product.

tests/
scripts/
.github/

# Artwork. consistency-grid.webp and gallery.webp are referenced by the README
# via absolute URL, so GitHub and the Registry render them without the bytes
# riding along into every install. workflow.webp is the animated source the
# five workflows/*.jpg thumbnails were cut from — keep it, or regenerating them
# means re-rendering the frames.
#
# workflows/*.jpg are NOT excluded: those are the thumbnails, and ComfyUI reads
# them from disk next to each workflow JSON. They must ship.
assets/

# Tooling caches and editor droppings, in case a publish runs from a working
# directory rather than a clean checkout.
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
